**Files changed:** `src/new_grep/new_grep.c`

**Behavior added:** `-h` / `--no-filename` option forces no filename prefix regardless of default rules.

**Last-one-wins resolution:** A single `force_filename` variable tracks the decision: `0` (default), `1` (`-H`/`--with-filename`), `-1` (`-h`/`--no-filename`). Whichever option appears last wins. Combined short options like `-Hh` and `-hH` are handled by iterating through characters.

